message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Construction Safety Risk Predictor"
type: software

authors:
  - given-names: Daniil
    family-names: Marchici

version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-17

repository-code: "https://github.com/Hickmanda/safety-risk-predictor"
url: "https://safety-risk-predictor.streamlit.app"

license: MIT

abstract: >
  An end-to-end MLOps project for predicting construction worker
  safety behavior from data generated by an agent-based simulation.
  The system includes synthetic data generation, machine-learning
  model training and evaluation, MLflow experiment tracking,
  threshold optimization, a FastAPI REST API, Docker
  containerization, CI/CD, and a Streamlit frontend.

keywords:
  - machine learning
  - MLOps
  - construction safety
  - agent-based modeling
  - XGBoost
  - FastAPI
  - MLflow
